<title>HONG KONG: HK's Regent Pac to offer 42.63 mln shares in IPO.</title>
<headline>HK's Regent Pac to offer 42.63 mln shares in IPO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based investment house Regent Pacific Group Ltd said on Monday it will offer 42.63 million new shares at HK$2.62 each to the public in Hong Kong as part of its initial public offering (IPO).  </p>
<p>The issue price represents a prospective price earnings multiple of 9.92 times on a weighted average basis.</p>
<p>On a fully diluted basis it stands at 9.89 times, the company said. -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
